{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"GHSA-7g64-f2hm-vjxp","published":"2026-06-26T00:32:05Z","modified":"2026-11-04T18:00:05.261433596Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-12975"],"summary":"Apicurio Registry utilities allow SSRF and denial of service through XML parsing","details":"A flaw was found in Apicurio Registry. The ContentTypeUtil.isParsableXml() method creates a SAXParserFactory without enabling secure processing features or disabling external entity resolution. An attacker with artifact-write permission (or unauthenticated when the registry runs with default configuration) can upload a crafted XML document to trigger blind server-side request forgery (SSRF) via external DTD/entity fetch, or cause denial of service via entity expansion.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"io.apicurio:apicurio-registry-schema-util-common","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/io.apicurio/apicurio-registry-schema-util-common"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"3.3.0"},{"fixed":"3.3.1"}]}],"versions":["3.3.0"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/06/GHSA-7g64-f2hm-vjxp/GHSA-7g64-f2hm-vjxp.json"}},{"package":{"name":"io.apicurio:apicurio-registry-schema-util-common","ecosystem":"Maven","purl":"pkg:maven/io.apicurio/apicurio-registry-schema-util-common"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.2.6"}]}],"versions":["2.1.4.Final","2.1.5.Final","2.2.0.Final","2.2.1.Final","2.2.2.Final","2.2.3.Final","2.2.4.Final","2.2.5.Final","2.3.0.Final","2.3.1.Final","2.4.0.Final","2.4.1.Final","2.4.10.Final","2.4.11.Final","2.4.12.Final","2.4.13.Final","2.4.14.Final","2.4.2.Final","2.4.3.Final","2.4.4.Final","2.4.5.Final","2.4.6.Final","2.4.7.Final","2.4.8.Final","2.4.9.Final","2.5.0.Final","2.5.1.Final","2.5.10.Final","2.5.11.Final","2.5.2.Final","2.5.3.Final","2.5.5.Final","2.5.6.Final","2.5.7.Final","2.5.8.Final","2.5.9.Final","2.6.0.Final","2.6.1.Final","2.6.11.Final","2.6.12.Fin